// MONK's twelve singers: name, role, accent colour and the voice each one loads onto the knobs (17 values in MK_*
// order, 0..1 – the same voices as before, per index, so old patches sound the same). The drawings are GENRA's own
// (res/monk/, made by tools/monk_singers.py).
